--- !u!1001 &7315541498022367476
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1932641877}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _deityName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].key
      value: quest_give
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The roots are quiet. That is how it should be.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Welcome to our village, little diver. Few from the dry world swim this
        far into the roots.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Manunubo sent word of you. You brought the scattered shoals home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: 'The fishers above take everything their nets touch: the young, the
        rare, the ones the sea cannot spare.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Then how should anyone fish?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: With care. Take only what is needed, and let the rest swim free.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].text
      value: You carry the Woven Net Fragment, Neguno's gift. Thrown well, it opens
        only where you aim, and closes around nothing else.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[6].text
      value: You will need it for what we ask. Equip it from your inventory, then
        come back to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The schools in your net-bag cannot stay in Ajuy. Each belongs in a home
        of its own, somewhere in these waters.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Equip the Compass. It will lead you to the sanctuaries, so you can bring
        each school safely to where it belongs.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: But hear me. Beyond the trench the sea falls into the deep, and a great
        serpent rests there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: It is the anger Manunubo spoke of. Swim softly, and do not disturb it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].speakerName
      value: '{player}'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[6].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[2].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[3].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Every school taken with care, and not one protected life harmed. You
        have learned well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The village has something for you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Keep it close. It was made by many hands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Thank you. I'll keep it safe.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Good. Now listen.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Eight schools in our pools are not safe here. They must go to safer
        waters, but only them, and only with care.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: 'Our fishers will teach you first: Amihan the throw, Lakan the seeing,
        Inang Sela the waiting.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Find Amihan at the western Root Pool. The tide will carry you there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: I'm ready to learn.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[4].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
