--- !u!1001 &7430725957819875958
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1125923153}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _deityName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.size
      value: 12
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].key
      value: quest_give
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: My shoals rest easy now. Go safely.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: "A diver\u2026 and a dugong at your side. Come closer, child of the
        surface. My light is weak tonight."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'I am Manunubo. I watch over these waters: the reefs, the seagrass,
        and every life that swims in them.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Centuries ago, this sea was clear as moonlight. The reefs shone, and
        the fish ran in shoals so great they shadowed the sand.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Then the surface began to give us its waste. Nets that never rot. Poison
        carried down the rivers. Fire that shatters the coral.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Year after year the water turned. And something old in the deep, something
        that loved this sea before any of us, grew angry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].text
      value: The sea has not known peace since. Now that anger has grown so great
        that when it stirred in its sleep, the whole sea shook.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[6].text
      value: My shoals broke apart in terror. They are scattered across the open
        sand, lost, where the sharks hunt.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[7].text
      value: What is down there?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[8].text
      value: 'Not yet. But the oldest songs of the sea remember: an anger of the
        deep is not fought. It is soothed with a ritual, a song sung back to it one
        face of the moon at a time.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[9].text
      value: You carry the Radiant Conch, Amansinaya's gift. I can feel its song
        from here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[10].text
      value: Its call means home. Blow it near my lost fish, and they will hear it,
        calm, and follow you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[11].text
      value: You will need it for what I ask of you. Equip it from your inventory,
        then come back to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: East, through the channel, the Kataw keep their village in the roots.
        They will teach you what my shoals cannot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'Look: the tide is already moving east, silver in the dark. Swim into
        it, and it will carry you.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[7].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.size
