      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[6].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[7].speakerName
      value: '{player}'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[8].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[9].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[10].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[11].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: They are home. Can you see? My light grows stronger with every school.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: You swam where the hunters swim and never once left a fish behind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'Take this gift: Moontide. The tides that carried my shoals will show
        themselves to you, and carry you as they carried them.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: "I can see the currents\u2026 the water is moving with me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Good. I can hear it humming in your hands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: My shoals are scattered across the sand. Find them, blow the conch,
        and lead them back to my light.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Mind the sharks. When they come, slip into the seaweed or the narrow
        rocks, wherever you see the closed eye, and keep still.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Or swim beside your dugong. The hunters will take you both for one of
        my shoal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: I'll bring them home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[5].text
      value: Go, {player}. And keep the conch close. Its song will be needed again,
        deeper than you think.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[4].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
